# vttest screen features (ADR-0332 item 10, ADR-0391 item 10): the pinned vttest (20251205) run from its main menu, menu 2, one
# mark per screen after each Return, recorded with the pinned entry (TERM as ADR-0333 says). vttest sends DA and
# waits for no answer here (nothing is answered, as in the other recordings). Its screens are what the terminal is
# compared with xterm on by a person: the grids are frozen from zoraya-term and NOT yet compared (docs/tasks/TASK-31-part-10d.md).
size 80 24
env TERMINFO=@terminfo@
run @vttest@/vttest
mark menu
send 2\r
wait 1
mark screen 1
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 2
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 3
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 4
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 5
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 6
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 7
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 8
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 9
send \r
wait 1
mark screen 10
